# Kaggle credentials. kaggle.json holds a live API key in plaintext; the CLI
# also looks for it in ~/.kaggle/, so a copy sitting in the repo root is easy to
# forget about and trivially committed by `git add .`.
kaggle.json
**/kaggle.json
.kaggle/

